            "source_segment_index": 3604,
            "start_ms": 7068060,
            "end_ms": 7069380,
            "text": "搜索并下载天天狼人app"
          },
          {
            "index": 3605,
            "source_segment_index": 3605,
            "start_ms": 7069380,
            "end_ms": 7070980,
            "text": "就可以跟我们一起来玩网杀游戏了"
          },
          {
            "index": 3606,
            "source_segment_index": 3606,
            "start_ms": 7070980,
            "end_ms": 7073900,
            "text": "同样我们本赛季还有两个特约的赞助商啊"
          },
          {
            "index": 3607,
            "source_segment_index": 3607,
            "start_ms": 7073900,
            "end_ms": 7075580,
            "text": "一个是我们的懒赤霞"
          },
          {
            "index": 3608,
            "source_segment_index": 3608,
            "start_ms": 7075580,
            "end_ms": 7077300,
            "text": "还有一个是我们柠檬共和国"
          },
          {
            "index": 3609,
            "source_segment_index": 3609,
            "start_ms": 7077300,
            "end_ms": 7078900,
            "text": "也希望各位家人们在观赛途中"
          },
          {
            "index": 3610,
            "source_segment_index": 3610,
            "start_ms": 7078900,
            "end_ms": 7081200,
            "text": "可以来到JYDH的主页的橱窗中"
          },
          {
            "index": 3611,
            "source_segment_index": 3611,
            "start_ms": 7081200,
            "end_ms": 7082480,
            "text": "随时下单补货"
          },
          {
            "index": 3612,
            "source_segment_index": 3612,
            "start_ms": 7082480,
            "end_ms": 7083820,
            "text": "感谢一下侯晓彤"
          },
          {
            "index": 3613,
            "source_segment_index": 3613,
            "start_ms": 7083820,
            "end_ms": 7085620,
            "text": "感谢一下解绑给我的投食"
          },
          {
            "index": 3614,
            "source_segment_index": 3614,
            "start_ms": 7085620,
            "end_ms": 7087900,
            "text": "然后接下来请导播老师把镜头移交至我们"
          },
          {
            "index": 3615,
            "source_segment_index": 3615,
            "start_ms": 7087900,
            "end_ms": 7088460,
            "text": "第二现场"
